WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.536
Long, long ago, in Songjiang there lived a clever, skillful weaving expert whose name was Huang Daopo.

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:19.550
Huang Daopo had learned advanced cotton-weaving techniques away from home, and she brought many new tools back to her hometown.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.284
She learned quickly and diligently, and her craft grew better and better.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:31.386
Huang Daopo improved the old spinning wheel with her own hands, and the cotton thread it spun was fine and even.

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:38.336
She patiently taught the villagers to tread the spinning wheels and weave cotton cloth, and laughter filled the village.

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:41.854
The villagers learned happily and improved quickly.

00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:49.428
Soon every household was weaving cotton cloth, and the fame of Songjiang cotton spread far and wide.

00:00:49.778 --> 00:00:53.810
The cotton cloth was soft and warm, and everyone loved it.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:01:01.600
In the end, Huang Daopo improved weaving technology and drove the flourishing growth of cotton weaving in the Jiangnan region.

